window.products.push({"id":449030,"name":"CRAFTSTORE14 Three Wise Monkeys Monk Figurines Set, Baby Buddha Statue, See No Evil, Hear No Evil, Speak No Evil, Zen Sculpture, Home Décor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":48.01,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61syLeu0+IL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"This is a set of three ceramic figurines. Inspired by three wise monkeys, these three monks cover their eyes, ears and mouth respectively, it means See No Evil Hear No Evil Speak No Evil. In ancient China, it is said that \"do not look at what is contrary to propriety, do not listen to what is contrary to propriety, do not say what is contrary to propriety\". In Buddhist tradition, the tenets of this proverb are about not dwelling on evil thoughts. In the Western world the proverb is often used to refer to a lack of moral responsibility on the part of people who refuse to acknowledge impropriety, looking the other way or feigning ignorance. These monk figurines are unique décor differ from traditional décor of Zen, because they are cute and funny, actually you can see them used as tea pet in tea ceremony. According to the different meanings and the image, it makes a good gift for friends and family, especially for kids, see no evil, hear no evil, speak no evil, DO NOT BE EVIL. Please bear in mind that photo may slightly different from actual item in terms of color due to the lighting during photo shooting or the monitor's display. Slight deformation and tiny flaws are allowed, because they are made by our craftsmen. Consider carefully please before you purchase, thank you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61syLeu0+IL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CRAFTSTORE14","source_asin":"B0827K1MNH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-449030","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0827K1MNH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0827K1MNH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
