window.products.push({"id":449138,"name":"New Large 3” Car Cupholder Coasters Absorbent Ceramic Set of 2 – Starry Night","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GfFBN013L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"We listened to your customer feedback on the size of our original car coaster being slightly too small for your vehicle and now we offer you our new larger 3 inch diameter car coasters! These are the perfect coasters for that art lover in your life! Although Vincent Van Gogh only managed to sell one painting during his entire life after his death his art would become famous globally. Stay inspired with this car coaster which has one of his most iconic pieces Starry Night wonderful UV printed on to the coaster. CatchtheBug coasters are made from the highest quality ultra-absorbent ceramic that soaks up water in seconds. We use UV printing technology which means quality crisp images that do not fade or wear over time. Larger diameter fits most modern car cup holders and measure: 3 in (75mm) Diameter (Exact measurement is 2.95 in) .3 in (7mm) Height (Exact measurement is 0.28 in) (Note: Although these fit most cup holder please measure your cup holder before purchase this is our larger offered size. Size is slightly large for some older model cars and maybe too large for some vehicles. For some cars, you must use a smaller 2.56 in diameter car coaster.) These coasters come with a beveled bottom edge for easy removal just push down on the corner with a beveled edge to tilt coaster upward and grab the lifted edge. Once removed our car coaster is simple to clean using a mild detergent and warm water lightly scrub surface use soft sponge or brush (avoid harsh brush so you do not damage UV printed design). After cleaning simply air-dry coasters before continued use. They make a great gift for anyone you care about girlfriends, moms, friends or anyone looking to keep their car clean or spice it up with these cool designs. Order Yours Today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GfFBN013L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CatchtheBug","source_asin":"B07YYKS9HZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-449138","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YYKS9HZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YYKS9HZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
