window.products.push({"id":449150,"name":"Coffee Canister, 1.1 Qt / 1.2L Coffee Containers, MISS BIG Coffee Vacuum Container for Keeping Fresh, Airtight Food Storage Containers for Cookie,Cand","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61x+xopi6AL._AC_SL1456_.jpg","description":"【Keeping Fresh For Longer Time】Our storage containers were exactly designed for coffee beans with vacuum, the extra air inside the coffee containers can be expelled out by the air pump on the lid for keeping the coffee 100% dry and fresh for at least 60 days. you can also use the coffee canister to store cookies, candy, sugar, tea, herbs, and so on, you will find the quality and scent of food are totally the same as the first time when you open the coffee containers. 【100% Airtightness & Vaccum】The double-layer silicone strip design of the coffee storage canister can completely isolate the air and keep the vacuum state that the cover is hard to be removed, compared with an automatic vacuum coffee canister which keeps the sealing for just less than 24 hours. 【Safe & Durable Materials】There are no BPAs and no chemical dyes by safe food-grade thicken PP materials which are also definitely durable and drop-resistant for longer life compared with stainless steel and glass. The clear body of coffee bean container makes it convenient to see what’s inside, we also provide 20 sticky labels, 15 sealed bags, 3 measuring cups, and 1 marker pen as gifts. 【Simplicity Of Operator】- The coffee storage canister is vacuumed by pressing the pump six to eight times on the lid. the user can easily judge whether is in a vacuum state by the silicone indicator on the seal cover, you just only lift the air valve and open the lid if you want to take out food. 【Note】- After sealing for a period of time, if the silicone membrane bulges upwards, it means that the air pressure of inside and outside are balanced, it does not mean that it is leaking, it is a normal phenomenon. And if the air valve is pulled out completely when deflating too hard, just plug it back into the original hole. 【Professional After-sales Service】- If for any reason you are not satisfied with this coffee storage canister, please feel free to contact us. Our food storage containers come with a 12-month hassle-free purchase guarantee and our lifetime warranty for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61x+xopi6AL._AC_SL1456_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MISS BIG","source_asin":"B0B8DG8QMF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-449150","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8DG8QMF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8DG8QMF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
