window.products.push({"id":449499,"name":"DINDON 2 Tier Pull Out Cabinet Organizer(14\" W X 18\" D), Double Tier Wire Basket Slide Out Shelf Storage for Kitchen Base Cabinet Organization ​for Ki","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":73.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QHYbklkuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Easy Access to Household Items: Organizing your kitchen cabinet space just got easier with the 2-tier pull out sliding shelf. Now you can declutter your space and easily access all your pots, pans, small kitchen appliances, cleaning products, canned goods, and Other items More Convenient and Practical: Both top and bottom shelves fully slide out independently on precision ball bearing slides so you can reach to your items easily and more quickly. Excellent Design: The upper and lower wire baskets has 2 height adjustment options, and the installation compatibility in the cabinet is better. When installing the lower wire basket, there are two heights to choose from, Which can easily solve the problem that the lower wire basket cannot be pulled out due to the lip of the cabinet. Easy to Install: Comes with all the hardware necessary for a quick, easy install. Rear mounting brackets are optional and can be used or not. This 2 tier slide out cabinet organizer needs at least 15 inch wide and larger cabinet openings. Min cabinet interior depth: 19 inch. Satisfaction Service：Durable slide out cabinet organizers are suitable for your kitchen, bathroom, pantry, laundry room, or any cabinet space that you want to keep neatly organized. Continuously improving product quality and customer experience is our purpose. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us and we will continue to follow up with your case until you are satisfied. JUST FOR A BETTER CUSTOMER EXPERIENCE：If you find missing accessories or instructions after receiving the package, Or if you have trouble during installation, please feel free to contact us, we will try our best to serve you, just for a better customer experience. JUST FOR A BETTER CUSTOMER EXPERIENCE：If you find missing accessories or instructions after receiving the package, Or if you have trouble during installation, please feel free to contact us, we will try our best to serve you, just for a better customer experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QHYbklkuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DINDON","source_asin":"B0BTV8PZYS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-449499","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTV8PZYS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTV8PZYS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":449500,"name":"Polish Pottery Coffee Mug Bubble 12 oz Gingham Flowers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UtlxLnx6L._AC_SL1352_.jpg","description":"Polish Pottery Bubble Mug 12 oz Gingham Flowers Dimensions: 3¾\" wide, 4¾\" long, 3¼\" high Capacity: 12oz Polmedia Polish Pottery Stoneware is: * Hand crafted and hand painted in Boleslawiec, Poland * Microwave safe, dishwasher safe, oven safe up to 480 F, freezer safe * Lead and cadmium free * Crack and chip resistant * Intended for everyday use, easy to clean * Highly collectable About Polish Pottery Polish pottery is known for its versatility in the kitchen and on the table. It is safe for use with food in the microwave, freezer, oven and dishwasher. Polish stoneware is resilient to abrasives making it durable and resistant to scratching or chipping. It distributes heat evenly for perfect baking and is also nonstick for easy clean-up, making it easy to care for. The bright patterns never fade, and are offered in thousands of variations to mix and match. It is this combination of function and beauty that makes Polish pottery so appealing. The pottery is fired in electric and gas kilns at temperatures exceeding 2200 degrees Fahrenheit. This results in a stoneware that is meant to resist aging and provide lasting beauty that stands the test of time. Polish stoneware is lead and cadmium free.Polish Pottery is hand crafted and hand painted in the Boleslawiec region of Poland. This region is famous for its naturally found white clay which artisans have used for centuries to craft this durable and beautiful stoneware. Each piece of pottery is carefully formed and painted by hand to ensure that exceptional attention to detail is paid to each piece. The most beautiful and intricate patterns are called UNIKAT patterns. These patterns bear the artist’s signature.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UtlxLnx6L._AC_SL1352_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Polmedia Polish Pottery","source_asin":"B00E57JEG0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-449500","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00E57JEG0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00E57JEG0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
