window.products.push({"id":449532,"name":"UKON Christmas Tree Storage Bag, 600D Oxford Waterproof Duffel Bag Fits 7.5 ft or 9 ft Xmas Trees Extra Large Heavy Duty Moving Bag with Handles (Blac","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91uoWCdvCAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Christmas Patterns Storage Bag: Our specially designed patterns full of Christmas elements will make your Christmas tree bag more special.We provide two sizes Christmas Waterproof Large Storage Bags,One Dimensions: 48” x 15” x 20”-Fits up to a 7.5ft Christmas tree ,Another: 65” x 15” x 30”-Fits up to a 9ft Christmas tree.Oversize Storage Bag great for your tree, garlands, and even lights,easily store your Christmas tree at the end of the year. Extremely Durable Material:Christmas Storage Bag made by dual layer 600d oxford canvas material，durable and waterproof. Whether you store your Christmas Holiday Extra Large Bag in a attic,garage or at home, your Christmas tree will be ready for the next holiday. Sturdy Dual Zipper and More Detail:Our Christmas storage bag has dual zipper that allows you to open the bag wide enough to place your tree,equipped with a pair of strong and sturdy reinforced handles on the side for easy carrying when fully loaded,it also comes with a PU tag compartment on front for card label.The stylish colors to fit any decor. Easy to Fold and Clean: The Large Storage Bag can be folded up completely flat and into small size to save space ,easy storage in a closet,drawer, luggage or car.The Holiday Extra Large Bag is very easy to clean. Just rinse the bag with water, let it dry and then store ,when you need to reuse it, there is no need to assemble ,just expand and insert your tree. Widely Applicable Storage Bag:These storage bags are very useful and versatile,it can store your Christmas Tree, Christmas holiday decorations,It can also be used as a large travel duffel bag ,help store your clothes ,move bulky items and carry things while traveling","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91uoWCdvCAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UKON","source_asin":"B09FJK3T2T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-449532","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FJK3T2T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FJK3T2T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":449533,"name":"Department 56 Snowpinions On Cloud Wine Hanging Ornament, 2.64 Inch, Multicolor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61te4frVdpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With a glass in her hand, this Snowpinions is on cloud wine right now! Department 56 artist Kristi Jensen Pierro, the driving force behind Snowbabies, sure knows how to have fun while she creates! Her playful collection of Snowmen with Attitude, appropriately called Snowpinions, features a wide variety of sentiments, ranging from downright sassy to oh-so-sweet. About Us: Enesco is committed to BRING JOY EVERY DAY. The premier global destination for high-quality giftware, and home decor, our prestigious family of brands includes: Department 56 Village, Snowbabies, Possible Dreams, Foundations, Jim Shore Heartwood Creek, Disney Traditions by Jim Shore,  Disney Showcase Collection, Disney by Britto, Designs by Lolita, Our Name Is Mud, and many more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61te4frVdpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Department 56","source_asin":"B08TJ577JP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-449533","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TJ577JP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TJ577JP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":449534,"name":"Bachelorette Party Sunglasses - Set of 1 Bride & 7 Team Bride Sun Glasses Pack of 8 Bridesmaid Favor Supplies Bridal Wedding","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TbIRaaJmL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"Imported Plastic frame Polycarbonate lens Non-Polarized Scratch Resistant Coating coating Lens width: 3 millimeters 😎 TAKE AMAZING PICTURES with these fun Bachelorette Party Supplies. Great for photo props. You will like them so much you will want to keep wearing them even after the wedding. 🎁 A GREAT GIFT - These cute and stylish wedding sunglasses are the perfect addition to your festivities. Afterwards your bride tribe will keep them as gifts. 🥂 CELEBRATE with your bridesmaids in style. You are sure to get the attention you deserve while wearing these classy accessories! 🕶️ PACK INCLUDES: One white pair of \"Bride\" sunglasses & seven black \"Team Bride\" sunglasses with a wedding ring image on the opposite side of the glasses. Plastic frames and lenses have scratch resistant coating - surprisingly durable for the price. 👍 GUARANTEED: We stand by all our products with a 100% money back guarantee, no questions asked.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TbIRaaJmL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brosash","source_asin":"B09Y1LC3BV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-449534","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Y1LC3BV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Y1LC3BV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":449535,"name":"Hand Painted Glass Christmas Ornament - Steamboat Springs, Colorado Winter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fPhrMqGnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Steamboat Springs, Colorado like you’ve never seen it before. This beautiful, reverse-painted glass ornament displays main street and surrounding mountains in full 360 degrees. It continues an ancient art-form prized by collectors. The artists choosing from a selection of miniature curved and bent-shafted brushes, painstakingly hand paints every minute detail on the inside of the ornament. The craft requires the artists to repeatedly insert the brush through the small opening in the sphere; first to outline the design, and then to detail the colors one by one. The entire process for each ornament requires up to two days. No two pieces are identical, making this inside-painted glass ornament a keepsake to be treasured from generation to generation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fPhrMqGnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Art Studio Company","source_asin":"B071G1PDLH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-449535","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071G1PDLH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071G1PDLH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
