window.products.push({"id":449577,"name":"Dicunoy Milk Butter Warmer Pot, 1qt Turkish Coffee Pot, Large Stovetop Melting Boiling Pot with Spout, Cezve Ibrik Briki Greek Arabic Coffee Maker for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613Xbx0GmRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Stovetop boiling pot with large 1qt/1000ml capacity, designed for stove top, perfect size for heating a few cups of coffee or milk for your family or yourself at one time, save your time in the morning. It can be widely used for heating coffee, milk, tea or melting butter, chocolate, maple syrup, sauce and Cezve, Ibrik, Briki, Greek, Arabic coffee making. Coffee warmer pot with spout and insulated handle design, perfect size to reheat coffee and pour with no drip, keep your tabletop clean. And the handle will keep your hands away from being scalded. Dicunoy milk heating pot is made of premium quality 18/8 stainless steel, it is healthy, sturdy, durable. And rust, high temperature, high pressure resistant and won't deform easily. Perfect for home, coffee shop, cake shop use. Easy to clean and store Turkish coffee maker pot, the wide mouth of this pot is easy to clean by hand. There also have hanging holes at the end of the handle for easy to hang and store. Dishware Safe. No microwave. Coffee pot size: 3.5\" in top diameter, 4\" in bottom diameter, 5\" in height, 5\" in handle length. Check your induction stove size compatibility before purchase. It should be less than 4 inches.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613Xbx0GmRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dicunoy","source_asin":"B09XVB7VWB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-449577","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XVB7VWB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XVB7VWB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":449578,"name":"Emile Henry 12-Inch Japanese Salad Bowl, Nougat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5193+8leEcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Urban Colors is a refreshing, new collection that mixes modern design with fun colors. Urban Colors offers a universe filled with light and sparkling charm. Flowery, citrus colors on simple shapes which break with tradition and bring a playful atmosphere to your kitchen. Our dishes have always been produced in France in Marcigny in the south of Burgundy: it is a tradition and savoir-faire which has been handed down from generation to generation. High resistance oven ceramic was developed for slow, even cooking in the oven and microwave. A dish or stewpot should be able to withstand wide variations in temperature. Our ceramics allow our products to be taken directly from the freezer to the hot over (+250C/500F). Heat, the dishwasher or sharp instruments will all have an ageing effect on a product. Our glazes are particularly resistant to the dishwasher and the most aggressive of detergents. We are proud to offer products made from very high quality ceramic, which pass very rigorous quality control by our team. We are therefore pleased to offer a 10 years guarantee on all Emile Henry products. Our warranty covers any production fault or quality problem with the product when used in a normal domestic environment, and respecting the care and use instructions. Any variation in the finish of the item is due to the handiwork carried out in our workshops and does not alter in any way the culinary qualities of our dishes. Inspired by the shape of Asian rice bowls, Emile Henry softened the edges, added beautiful glazes and finished if off with the potter's stamp on the bottom, The Japanese 7.5 inch salad bowl makes a sensational statement in the Urban colors. The cup is modern, elegant, casual and refined and is a versatile size and shape. It is made from Burgundy clay so it retains heat longer at the table. It can be placed directly into a preheated oven or in the microwave so soups, stews and beverages can be heated directly in the cup.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5193+8leEcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Emile Henry","source_asin":"B007VZZE80","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-449578","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007VZZE80","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007VZZE80","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
