window.products.push({"id":449598,"name":"Shalinindia Indian Christmas Decorations Candle Tea Light Holder Floral Arrangements- Lovely Gift Idea for Any Occasion- Perfect for Everyday Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819W2h3hCUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ShalinIndia's golden and colorful tea light candle holders are used as diyas for decorating floors at the entrance door of home or or the puja mandir. People also use these decorative floral tea lights for decorating floor around the Christmas tree. Indian floor decorations Diwali diya floral tea light candle holders The decor of your home will be in full bloom with this exquisite candle holder. With two cast iron cups, this decoration for everyday decor or Christmas celebrations holds two standard tea light candles of your choosing. Light their wicks and watch as their light reflects off the 12 amber-colored gemstone beads, which are placed in trios with wrought iron petals to give them the look of flowers. Seven cast iron roses with meticulously formed petals add to the elegance of the design, and the large one in the center is trimmed with gold glitter. A total of seven gold-toned leaves with glitter accents finish the design. This candle tea light holder was designed with these traditions in mind to serve as a beautiful piece of Christmas decor for the homes of Hindu families and allow everyone else to bring a beautiful Indian tradition into their own homes. This tea candle holder is an authentic Indian design produced by skilled artisans who reside in Kashmir, India. Constructed out of iron.The cup has a lustrous gold finish and is surrounded by three wrought iron roses in a matching shade of gold. Textured leaves add realism to the design. Whether you're looking for a Christmas gift, something to add to your collection of Christmas decorations or tea lights holders to display every day in your home, you're sure to be impressed by the beauty and quality of our tealight candle holders. Order the Gold and Red Candle Holder for Tea Lights now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819W2h3hCUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shalinindia","source_asin":"B07JVRLFT2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-449598","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JVRLFT2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JVRLFT2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
