window.products.push({"id":449640,"name":"Silicone Food Storage Preservation Snacks Bags Reusable Container Versatile Cooking Bag for Heatable Frozen Microwave Fruits Vegetables Meat Milk and ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QOFs5rilL._AC_SL1316_.jpg","description":"The silicone food storage preservation snacks bags are here to keep them neat and organized.And you are no longer worried about a messy fridge and kitchen and reduce the use of disposable bags and protect the environment.They are safely used in microwave oven, refrigerator, toaster, freezer, dishwasher, available in kitchen and outdoors for carrying. Features: ✔The silicone food storage preservation snacks bags expand with a flat bottom allowing bag to easily stand on its own. ✔Easy use in the oven, microwave, dishwasher, freezer or boiling water. ✔Measurement markings are conveniently placed on the outside of the container (cup, ml, oz). ✔A great alternative to non-biodegradable zip-top plastic bags. Specifications: 1.Healthy, Reusable and durable, long lifespan. 2.Resistant temperature: -40°C～+230°C. 3.The silicone food storage preservation snacks bags are Leak-proof vacuum sealed and zip-locked, can storage vegetable, fruit,meat and liquid. 4.Product Dimensions:each bags 7.87*7inches(20*18cm) 0.28lb(130g) 1000ml Please Note: ☞ Although the silicone food storage preservation snacks bags are made from food grade, environmentally friendly silicone materials. But it may have a little smell for the first time. ☞ Before first use, please soak in salt water for 24 hours, and put it in the ventilated area to get rid of the smell. ☞ When you start to use it for first several times,the lock for the bag may a little tight seal,that's for a special purpose to make the best effect of preservation. ☞ Please remove sliding bar before heating, the sliding bar is not microwaved. ☞ To prevent scratch, please do not use the sharp weapons. Package Include: 4 x Silicone Food bag","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QOFs5rilL._AC_SL1316_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"REBBONXY","source_asin":"B07SD1JW1S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-449640","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SD1JW1S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SD1JW1S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
