window.products.push({"id":449757,"name":"Smart Air Beds Raised Cross Beam Flocked Inflatable Mattress with AC Pump, Bag and Patch Kit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51vBvWd3vUL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Have you ever stayed at someone's house and slept on their old sofa day bed? Or a futon mattress? Or maybe you and your spouse were forced to share a twin size bed? NO MORE! Raised 20\" off the ground, the Smart Air Beds Deluxe Flock Top Full Size Inflatable Mattress is exactly what you're looking for if you have overnight guests coming or you plan on doing some traveling yourself. Complete with a soft flocked top sleep surface, at 20\" this air bed is almost the height of a traditional box spring and mattress (about 25\"), so you or your guests are up off the floor, away from any cold drafts. Engineered with a comfort top construction, the Smart Air Beds Raised Cross Beam Flocked Full Size Inflatable Mattress comes as close as you can get to a traditional mattress with regards to support and stability. The 23 gauge (.60 mm) super-thick, water proof flocked top and 14 gauge (.35 mm) sides and bottom give this air bed 400 lbs. weight capacity. The whole bed has expertly electronically welded seams for long lasting quality. The handheld powerful ETL listed A/C pump can have the mattress ready from box to bed in about 4 minutes. The pump, which is external and detachable, can be used to inflate other inflatables as well. The bed uses standard full sheets (not included), and the fitted sheet is aided by the flocked topping and a well placed horizontal groove along all sides to limit sheet slippage. Patented anti-roll edges on the sides and at the foot and the head of the bed are a little bit higher, keeping you on the bed and off the floor. When you're ready to pack the item up, simply open the patented 2-in-1 valve to release the air, roll and fold, and store the item neatly in the included storage bag - easy to keep in a linen closet, under a desk (for those of you who take naps at work) or anywhere with limited space. Note: item size may vary slightly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51vBvWd3vUL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Smart Air Beds","source_asin":"B003MUDT44","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-449757","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003MUDT44","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003MUDT44","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":449758,"name":"C.R. Gibson Jessie Steele Pocket Page Recipe Book, Dotted Cottage Rose","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xwQi4J+oL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Nothing says home quite like the kitchen. The story of our lives is lived there and as the recognized leader in recipe storage products, C.R. Gibson offers a stylish way to record and organize the heart of these moments with matching accessories that brighten up the whole kitchen. You can trust C.R. Gibson, synonymous with quality for more than 140 years. Starting with the creation of the very first baby book in 1898, families around the world have depended on C.R. Gibson as their number one provider of products that celebrate life's most cherished moments. Today you'll not only find baby books and photo albums, you'll also find a wide choice of party supplies, gift ideas and little luxuries to make your life easier and more colorful. Understanding the importance of design and craftsmanship, all C.R. Gibson products offer a tradition of quality in products that highlight classic styling as well as today's top fashions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xwQi4J+oL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"C.R. Gibson","source_asin":"B00B5KX28Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-449758","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00B5KX28Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00B5KX28Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
