window.products.push({"id":449818,"name":"YOLETO Corner Shower Caddy Bathroom Organizer Shower Shelf for Inside Shower with Soap Dish Holder and Hooks, Shower Shelves Bathtub Basket Rack for S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xvHz4MfwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Metal 【Premium Materials】The shower rack organizer is strong and not easy to be deformed, and the anti-rust and anti-corrosion technology ensures that it will not rust for a long time. Black coating, simple and elegant appearance design, perfectly integrated into home decoration. 【Improve Space Utilization】The shower shelf corner is only fits 90˚right angle corner, making perfect use of the corner space of the bathroom,toilet, kitchen, bedroom, study, living room, college, dorm and room . Our shower shelves is an ideal choice for storing shampoo, shower gel, cream, etc. Efficient corner space organizer, saves space and also has excellent storage function. 【Strong Adhesive Hook】The package contents 2 shower organizer, 6 super sticky adhesive hooks and 4 extra IG style adhesive hooks. The surface of the adhesive paste adopts metal drawing process, which is in contact with the wall in a large area, high viscosity, to ensure no drop, no displacement, and can bear 11ibs (5kg). Fashionable shape hooks can hang bags, clothes, keys, kitchen supplies, etc. It is very versatile. Easy to install and can also be disassembled as needed. 【No Drilling Installation】 Step1: Wipe the surface and make sure there’s no dust, water and oil on it. Step2: Determine where to install the shelf, you can mark on the wall with a pencil. Step3: Take off the sticky hooks, peel off the back cover and stick them on the position measured on the last step. Step4: Press them and make sure there’s no air inside the sticky patch. Step5: Hang the shelf on the transparent sticky hook. Leave it for 48 hours before using. 【Attention Please】1.Please keep the surface is clean and dry. 2. make a mark with pen. 3. The adhesive hooks can only be sticked on smooth, clean and evenly surfaces like marbled or tiled wall and glass and don't use on rough surface wall, painted wall, wallpaper wall, lime wall, cement wall. if you need to use it on a painted wall or wall paper, please fix it with screws and power drill. (not included ) 4. Please do wait for 48 hours to put heavy things on it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xvHz4MfwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YOLETO","source_asin":"B08JPGXTC3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-449818","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JPGXTC3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JPGXTC3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
