window.products.push({"id":449866,"name":"Jetty Home 6 Piece Nautical Beach Wine Glass Charm Gift Set, Cork","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UFztYi+lL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Sick of those metal wine charms that bang on your delicate wine and drinking glasses when you take a sip? Worry no more. Jetty Home’s nautical wine glass charm set ensures that you can safely (and quietly) differentiate your glasses in style. The set features six cork nautical themed wine charms with metal clasps. The cork lets you enjoy your drink without worrying about the charms moving around and damaging your glass. Each charm has a different nautical themed image – including a whale, anchor, shell, sailboat, starfish and seahorse – to help you and your guests to keep track of your drink. From an imitate dinner party to large wedding reception, these nautical wine charms will make sure that you never lose your glass at a party again! These charm markers are also great for a variety of other drink glasses, such as champagne, martinis, margaritas or anything else with a long stem.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UFztYi+lL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jetty Home","source_asin":"B01EMC4S7W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-449866","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01EMC4S7W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01EMC4S7W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
