window.products.push({"id":449946,"name":"GiftWay Clearance Queen Size Air Mattress Upgraded Air Bed - Inflatable Air Mattress with Flocked Top Patch Kit - Portable Blow up Air Bed for Camping","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MUDOd-j-S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔️ALL-NIGHT COMFORT: This air mattress is designed with coil beam construction, which can support the spine and body well. Double-sealed valves and precision seams avoid air leakage ensuring a comfortable sleep experience all night. Don’t worry about collapsing after waking up. It is raised about 9 inches from the floor,insulating you from the cold & wet ground surface.Whether you use it outdoors or at home, you can be sure to enjoy a deep sleep all night long. ✔️HIGH-QUALITY MATERIALS: The air bed is made of PVC flocking thickened quality material to ensure that the mattress is firm and sealed to avoid sinking or air leakage. Air mattress has super bearing capacity (650lbs,), soft and skin-friendly, comfortable and durable. In addition, this ergonomically designed air bed structure provides bed-like comfort for a great night's sleep. It is also easy to clean, simply use soapy water or a cloth to clean the surface of the inflatable mattress. ✔️EASY TO CARRY - Air Mattress with a 2-in-1 valve can quickly complete full inflation or full deflation within 3 minutes. After being inflating, the size is 76*56*9inches, the queen air bed is wider than a typical twin air mattress. Whenever you would like to move this air bed, simply deflate it and its foldable and light-weight features enable you to carry it everywhere you want. Also, it can be stored anywhere with just a little space.(no included pump) ✔️GREAT FOR ALL OCASIONS: Air bed is designed for in-home use and camping trips. The air bed is Lightweight and compact for you to take it on the go and won't take up too much space for tent camping while still ensuring a good night's sleep by insulating you from the cold & wet ground. Eg: Traveling, Hiking, Backpacking, Swimming, Office, School and as a temporary bed for your guests or when moving to a new place. The air bed for a wide range of occasion is our design concept. ✔️INDUSTRY LEADING SERVICE: This blow up mattress is comfortable as a real bed but saves you haft of the money. We provide a 2-YEAR warranty-Rest assured on your purchase. You will also enjoy life-long professional after-service. The air mattress will provides a comfortable night of sleep at an affordable price. If the camping air mattress is air-leaking without any reason, contact us for a new replacement, free of charge & without return. Built For Maximum Comfort - We Stand Behind Our Quality.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MUDOd-j-S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GiftWay","source_asin":"B0BDRFTN8B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-449946","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDRFTN8B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDRFTN8B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
