window.products.push({"id":449985,"name":"SPECIAL BUY 1/2L Deutschland Crests German Beer Stein ONE Stein Made in Germany","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dmnSHhDSL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"This beautiful stoneware beer stein was handcrafted in Germany by Zoeller & Born. . This attractive stein has a pewter lid. . The decal features an eagle, with the text Deutschland Germany surrounded by the names and crests of the 16 German states. . On one side is a handpainted relief of a castle and on the other side is an alpine village chalet . . This .5 liter stein is about 9.5 inches tall. . This part number consists of ONE stein. . Zoeller and Born is a family owned operation that has been producing high quality beer steins since 1956. They specialize in steins with stunning handpainted relief. Zoeller and Born is one of only a few remaining German stein companies that still produce their steins in Germany with 100% German materials and German labor..","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dmnSHhDSL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pinnacle Peak Trading Company","source_asin":"B00AAQBGG6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-449985","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00AAQBGG6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00AAQBGG6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
